JB SIP
======

This distribution is the Android application "JB SIP" (applicationId
br.com.jb.voip), a softphone for private SIP servers (Asterisk/FreePBX).

It is a modified version (derivative work) of the open source project
"linphone-android", Copyright (c) 2010-2026 Belledonne Communications SARL,
licensed under the GNU General Public License version 3 (GPLv3).
See LICENSE.txt for the full license text.

Modifications
-------------

The source code in this repository was modified in 2026 to:

* rebrand the application as "JB SIP" (application name, launcher icon,
  splash screen, colors and notification icon);
* point the default configuration to a private SIP account instead of the
  Linphone SIP service, and remove Linphone service endpoints, STUN servers,
  log upload and update check URLs;
* disable the Linphone account creation/login flow and the assistant paths
  that lead to it;
* disable group chats, meetings and conferences, keeping 1-to-1 SIP MESSAGE
  text chat only;
* remove all ways to send or receive media/attachments in the chat;
* clean the Help/Troubleshooting screens of Linphone-specific entries;
* harden the background keep-alive (START_STICKY service, restart on boot,
  battery optimization/autostart guidance) and
* remove Linphone-specific URI schemes and media share intent filters.

Original copyright notices and the GPLv3 license headers were kept in every
source file, as required by the license.

